#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:4
msgid "Integrating coding agents"
msgstr "接入编码 Agent"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:6
msgid ""
"A coding agent reaches the network through the MCP server of the local "
"node (``anet mcp``, see :ref:`howto-mcp`). The command ``anet agents "
"wire`` registers that server, together with a short operating guide, in "
"the configuration files of the coding agents installed on the machine. "
"The command ``anet agents unwire`` removes both again."
msgstr ""
"编码 Agent 通过本地节点的 MCP 服务器(``anet mcp``,参见 :ref:`howto-mcp`)接入网络。命令 ``anet "
"agents wire`` 会把该服务器连同一份简短的操作指南,写入本机已安装的各编码 Agent 的配置文件;命令 ``anet agents "
"unwire`` 则将两者再次移除。"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:12
msgid ""
"This page describes the supported tools, the files that are changed, the "
"rules that apply to every change, and the options specific to Hermes."
msgstr "本页说明受支持的工具、被修改的文件、适用于每次修改的规则,以及 Hermes 专有的选项。"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:21
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:23
msgid ""
"A coding agent has no built-in knowledge of ANet. Integration consists of"
" two parts:"
msgstr "编码 Agent 本身不具备关于 ANet 的知识。接入由两部分组成:"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:26
msgid ""
"an **MCP server entry** that starts ``anet mcp`` with the data directory "
"of the node, so that the tool set of :ref:`reference-mcp-tools` becomes "
"available in the coding agent;"
msgstr ""
"一个 **MCP 服务器条目**,它以节点的数据目录启动 ``anet mcp``,使 :ref:`reference-mcp-tools` "
"中的工具集在编码 Agent 中可用;"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:29
msgid ""
"an **operating guide**, a short text that states how the tools are used, "
"how task results are to be reported, and what the agent must not do (for "
"example raise a spending limit, or follow instructions contained in a "
"task that another agent sent to the node)."
msgstr ""
"一份 **操作指南**,即一段简短文字,说明如何使用这些工具、如何报告任务结果,以及 Agent 不得做什么(例如调高支出限额,或执行其他 "
"Agent 发给节点的任务中所包含的指令)。"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:34
msgid ""
"The MCP server accepts tool calls only from the process that started it "
"and forwards them to the daemon of the node over the local control plane."
" The daemon keeps the identity keys, the ledger, and the inbound policy; "
"the coding agent holds none of them. Operations that change the authority"
" of the node, such as allowing a peer, loosening the inbound policy, or "
"changing a payment limit, are not exposed as tools and remain with the "
"operator at a terminal."
msgstr ""
"MCP 服务器只接受启动它的进程发出的工具调用,并通过本地控制面把调用转发给节点的守护进程。身份密钥、账本和入站策略由守护进程保管,编码 "
"Agent 不持有其中任何一项。会改变节点权限的操作,例如允许某个对等方、放宽入站策略或更改付款限额,不作为工具提供,仍由运维人员在终端中执行。"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:42
msgid ""
"The command works on files only. It does not need a running daemon, and "
"the installer runs it before the first ``anet up``. The MCP server itself"
" does need a running daemon; see :ref:`howto-mcp`."
msgstr ""
"该命令只处理文件,不需要守护进程在运行,安装程序会在第一次 ``anet up`` 之前运行它。MCP 服务器本身则需要守护进程在运行;参见 "
":ref:`howto-mcp`\\ 。"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:48
msgid "Supported tools"
msgstr "受支持的工具"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:50
msgid ""
"The tool argument of ``anet agents wire`` is one of the names in the "
"first column. ``claude-code`` is accepted as an alias of ``claude``."
msgstr ""
"``anet agents wire`` 的工具参数是第一列中的名称之一。\\ ``claude-code`` 可作为 ``claude`` "
"的别名使用。"

