#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:86
msgid ""
"A tool counts as present when its executable is on ``PATH`` or its "
"configuration directory exists. WorkBuddy is a desktop application "
"without a command-line program, so it counts as present when "
"``~/.workbuddy`` exists. Without a tool argument, or with ``--all``, the "
"command wires every supported tool that is present and reports the others"
" as not installed. A tool that is named explicitly is wired even when it "
"is not detected."
msgstr ""
"工具的可执行文件位于 ``PATH`` 中,或其配置目录存在时,即视为已安装。WorkBuddy 是没有命令行程序的桌面应用,因此在 "
"``~/.workbuddy`` 存在时视为已安装。不带工具参数或使用 ``--all`` "
"时,命令会为每个已安装的受支持工具接入,并将其余工具报告为未安装。显式指定名称的工具即使未被检测到,也会接入。"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:94
msgid "Claude Code"
msgstr "Claude Code"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:96
msgid ""
"The server is registered in the user scope, which applies to every "
"project on the machine. When ``claude`` is on ``PATH`` the entry is "
"created with ``claude mcp add -s user``, because Claude Code manages the "
"locking and the format of its own file. When ``claude`` is not on "
"``PATH`` the command edits ``~/.claude.json`` directly. The operating "
"guide is installed as a skill; it is loaded when a task mentions ANet, "
"and it does not occupy the context of other sessions."
msgstr ""
"服务器注册在用户作用域内,对本机上的所有项目生效。\\ ``claude`` 位于 ``PATH`` 中时,条目通过 ``claude mcp "
"add -s user`` 创建,因为 Claude Code 自行管理其文件的加锁和格式。\\ ``claude`` 不在 ``PATH`` "
"中时,命令直接编辑 ``~/.claude.json``\\ 。操作指南以技能形式安装;任务提到 ANet 时才会加载,不会占用其他会话的上下文。"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:105
msgid "Codex"
msgstr "Codex"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:107
msgid ""
"The Codex command-line program, the IDE extension and the desktop "
"application share ``~/.codex/config.toml``, or the file in the directory "
"named by ``CODEX_HOME``. The entry is written inside a block delimited by"
" marker comments. The values ``startup_timeout_sec = 30`` and "
"``tool_timeout_sec = 900`` are set explicitly: the tool ``wait_task`` "
"blocks until a task changes state, and a task of a remote agent is "
"measured in minutes, whereas the default tool timeout of Codex is 60 "
"seconds."
msgstr ""
"Codex 命令行程序、IDE 扩展和桌面应用共用 ``~/.codex/config.toml``,或 ``CODEX_HOME`` "
"所指目录中的同名文件。条目写入由标记注释界定的块内。\\ ``startup_timeout_sec = 30`` 与 "
"``tool_timeout_sec = 900`` 被显式设置:工具 ``wait_task`` 会一直阻塞到任务状态改变,而远程 Agent "
"的任务以分钟计,Codex 默认的工具超时为 60 秒。"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:115
msgid ""
"Codex reads ``AGENTS.override.md`` instead of ``AGENTS.md`` when the file"
" exists in the global directory. In that case the operating guide is not "
"loaded, and ``wire`` reports the file. A ``.codex/config.toml`` in a "
"trusted project takes precedence over the user file; ``wire`` does not "
"inspect it. The official reference is "
"`<https://developers.openai.com/codex/mcp>`_."
msgstr ""
"全局目录中存在 ``AGENTS.override.md`` 时,Codex 读取它而不是 "
"``AGENTS.md``。此时操作指南不会被加载,\\ ``wire`` 会报告该文件。受信任项目中的 "
"``.codex/config.toml`` 优先于用户级文件,\\ ``wire`` 不检查它。官方参考:\\ "
"`<https://developers.openai.com/codex/mcp>`_\\ 。"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:122
msgid "Cursor"
msgstr "Cursor"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:124
msgid ""
"The entry is written to ``~/.cursor/mcp.json``, which is read by the "
"editor and by the Cursor command-line agent (the program is named "
"``agent`` in the current documentation; earlier releases used ``cursor-"
"agent``). Cursor has no user-level rules file, so no operating guide is "
"installed. An older rule file written by a previous release under "
"``~/.cursor/rules`` is removed when its content identifies it as ANet's."
msgstr ""
"条目写入 ``~/.cursor/mcp.json``,编辑器和 Cursor 命令行 Agent 均会读取该文件(当前文档中该程序名为 "
"``agent``,早期版本使用 ``cursor-agent``)。Cursor 没有用户级的规则文件,因此不安装操作指南。由先前版本写入 "
"``~/.cursor/rules`` 的旧规则文件,在其内容表明属于 ANet 时会被移除。"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:132
msgid "opencode"
msgstr "opencode"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:134
msgid ""
"The entry uses the opencode form, with ``\"type\": \"local\"``, the "
"command and its argument in one array, an explicit ``enabled`` flag, and "
"``environment`` in place of ``env``. When only ``opencode.jsonc`` exists,"
" that file is the target. The editor does not preserve comments: if the "
"file contains comments, the command makes no change and prints the entry "
"for manual insertion."
msgstr ""
"条目采用 opencode 的格式:``\"type\": \"local\"``,命令及其参数放在同一个数组中,带有显式的 "
"``enabled`` 标志,并以 ``environment`` 取代 ``env``\\ 。仅存在 ``opencode.jsonc`` "
"时,以该文件为目标。编辑器不保留注释:文件中含有注释时,命令不作任何更改,而是输出该条目,供手动插入。"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:142
msgid "Hermes"
msgstr "Hermes"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:144
msgid ""
"The entry runs the binary directly, without a shell wrapper. Hermes names"
" the tools ``mcp_anet_<tool>``, for example ``mcp_anet_list_agents``; the"
" operating guide in ``SOUL.md`` uses these names. On native Windows the "
"default home directory of Hermes differs from ``~/.hermes``; set "
"``HERMES_HOME`` to the directory in use. The timeouts are ``timeout: "
"900`` and ``connect_timeout: 30``. Optional ``a2a_agents`` entries are "
"described in :ref:`howto-coding-agents-hermes-a2a`."
msgstr ""
"条目直接运行二进制文件,不经过 shell 包装。Hermes 将工具命名为 ``mcp_anet_<tool>``,例如 "
"``mcp_anet_list_agents``,\\ ``SOUL.md`` 中的操作指南使用这些名称。在原生 Windows 上,Hermes"
" 的默认主目录不是 ``~/.hermes``,需将 ``HERMES_HOME`` 设为实际使用的目录。超时设置为 ``timeout: "
"900`` 与 ``connect_timeout: 30``。可选的 ``a2a_agents`` 条目参见 :ref:`howto-"
"coding-agents-hermes-a2a`\\ 。"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:153
msgid "Wiring and unwiring"
msgstr "接入与移除"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:156
msgid "Synopsis"
msgstr "用法概要"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:164
msgid ""
"``--all`` and explicit tool names are mutually exclusive. ``--refresh`` "
"and ``--a2a`` apply to Hermes; ``--refresh`` is accepted by ``wire`` "
"only. The command exits with a non-zero status when at least one tool "
"ended in a conflict or an error, so that an installer cannot report "
"success after a partial result."
msgstr ""
"``--all`` 与显式指定的工具名称互斥。\\ ``--refresh`` 和 ``--a2a`` 适用于 Hermes;\\ "
"``--refresh`` 只被 ``wire`` "
"接受。至少有一个工具以冲突或错误告终时,命令以非零状态退出,使安装程序不会在部分结果的情况下报告成功。"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:171
msgid "Procedure"
msgstr "步骤"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:173
msgid "Initialise and start the node, if this has not been done:"
msgstr "如尚未完成,先初始化并启动节点:"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:180
msgid "Register the server with the coding agents on the machine:"
msgstr "向本机的编码 Agent 注册服务器:"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:186
msgid "A single tool is wired by name:"
msgstr "按名称接入单个工具:"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:192
msgid ""
"Restart the coding agent, or start a new session. The tools are loaded at"
" the start of a session."
msgstr "重启编码 Agent,或开启新会话。工具在会话开始时加载。"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:195
msgid "Check the result:"
msgstr "检查结果:"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:201
msgid ""
"The command reports one state for each tool: not installed, not wired, "
"wired and current, wired but outdated (the entry or the guide differs "
"from what ``wire`` would write now), or conflict. For an outdated entry "
"the report names the command that corrects it."
msgstr ""
"命令为每个工具报告一种状态:未安装、未接入、已接入且为最新、已接入但已过时(条目或指南与 ``wire`` "
"现在会写入的内容不同),或冲突。对于已过时的条目,报告会给出用于更正的命令。"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:206
msgid ""
"In the coding agent, request the tool ``node_status``. A response that "
"contains the AID and the version of the node confirms that the chain from"
" the agent to the daemon works. If the daemon is not running, the MCP "
"server does not start; the client reports a failed connection."
msgstr ""
"在编码 Agent 中调用工具 ``node_status``\\ 。若响应中包含节点的 AID 和版本,则说明从 Agent "
"到守护进程的链路工作正常。守护进程未运行时,MCP 服务器不会启动;客户端会报告连接失败。"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:211
msgid "Removal is symmetric:"
msgstr "移除的方式与之对称:"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:218
msgid ""
"``unwire`` removes the MCP entry, the operating guide, and every "
"``a2a_agents`` entry together with its token. An entry with the name "
"``anet`` that ANet did not write is left unchanged and reported."
msgstr ""
"``unwire`` 会移除 MCP 条目、操作指南,以及每个 ``a2a_agents`` 条目及其令牌。名为 ``anet`` 但并非由 "
"ANet 写入的条目保持不变,并会报告出来。"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:224
msgid "Rules that apply to every change"
msgstr "适用于每次修改的规则"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:226
msgid ""
"The command edits configuration files of other programs. The same rules "
"apply to every tool:"
msgstr "该命令会编辑其他程序的配置文件。对每个工具适用相同的规则:"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:229
msgid "Backup"
msgstr "备份"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:230
msgid ""
"Before a file is changed it is copied to ``<name>.anet-bak-<UTC time>`` "
"next to the original. An existing backup is never overwritten."
msgstr "修改文件之前,先把它复制为原文件旁的 ``<name>.anet-bak-<UTC 时间>``\\ 。已有的备份从不覆盖。"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:233
msgid "Absolute binary path and pinned identity"
msgstr "绝对路径的二进制文件与固定身份"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:234
msgid ""
"The entry names the ``anet`` binary by absolute path and sets "
"``ANET_DATA_DIR`` to the data directory of the identity that was selected"
" when the command ran. An MCP client does not load the shell profile of "
"the operator, and ``anet mcp`` resolves strictly once an identity is "
"pinned: it reaches the daemon of that identity and no other. To wire "
"another identity, select it with ``--id``:"
msgstr ""
"条目以绝对路径指明 ``anet`` 二进制文件,并把 ``ANET_DATA_DIR`` 设置为命令运行时所选身份的数据目录。MCP "
"客户端不会加载运维人员的 shell 配置文件,而且一旦身份被固定,\\ ``anet mcp`` "
"就严格解析:它只连接该身份的守护进程,不连接其他任何守护进程。要接入另一个身份,请用 ``--id`` 选择:"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:245
msgid ""
"A tool has one ``anet`` entry; a later ``wire`` for another identity "
"replaces the entry written earlier. A binary started through ``go run`` "
"is refused, because the temporary build directory disappears when the "
"process exits."
msgstr ""
"每个工具只有一个 ``anet`` 条目;之后为另一个身份执行的 ``wire`` 会替换先前写入的条目。通过 ``go run`` "
"启动的二进制文件会被拒绝,因为进程退出时临时构建目录会消失。"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:250
msgid "Atomic writes"
msgstr "原子写入"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:251
msgid ""
"A file is written to a sibling temporary file and renamed. The mode of "
"the replaced file is kept."
msgstr "文件先写入同级的临时文件再重命名。被替换文件的权限模式得以保留。"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:254
msgid "Idempotence"
msgstr "幂等性"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:255
msgid ""
"Running ``wire`` twice changes nothing the second time. After an upgrade "
"of ``anet``, running it again updates the operating guide and, where the "
"binary path changed, the entry."
msgstr "运行两次 ``wire``,第二次不会产生任何更改。升级 ``anet`` 之后再次运行,会更新操作指南,并在二进制文件路径改变时更新条目。"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:259
msgid "Conflicts"
msgstr "冲突"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:260
msgid ""
"An existing entry with the name ``anet`` whose command is not ``anet "
"mcp`` is not overwritten. The tool is reported as a conflict, nothing is "
"changed for that tool, and the exit status is non-zero. The conflicting "
"entry is removed or renamed by the operator, and ``wire`` is run again. "
"The same applies to a table ``mcp_servers.anet`` in a Codex file that was"
" not written by ``anet agents wire``; the report gives the line number."
msgstr ""
"已有名为 ``anet`` 但命令不是 ``anet mcp`` "
"的条目不会被覆盖。该工具会被报告为冲突,对其不作任何更改,且退出状态为非零。运维人员移除或重命名冲突的条目后,再次运行 ``wire``\\ "
"。对于 Codex 文件中并非由 ``anet agents wire`` 写入的表 "
"``mcp_servers.anet``,处理方式相同;报告会给出行号。"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:267
msgid "Managed blocks"
msgstr "受管理的块"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:268
msgid ""
"In TOML, YAML and Markdown files the command edits only the text between "
"its own marker lines. Edits inside a managed block are overwritten by the"
" next ``wire``."
msgstr ""
"在 TOML、YAML 和 Markdown 文件中,命令只编辑其自身标记行之间的文本。在受管理的块内所做的修改,会被下一次 ``wire`` "
"覆盖。"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:272
msgid "Superseded content"
msgstr "已被取代的内容"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:273
msgid ""
"Earlier releases appended a persona block to ``~/.claude/CLAUDE.md``, "
"wrote a rule file under ``~/.cursor/rules``, and, through ``anet install "
"--agent openclaw``, appended a block to ``~/.openclaw/AGENTS.md``. "
"``wire`` removes the Claude Code block and the Cursor file; ``wire "
"--all`` and ``unwire --all`` remove the OpenClaw block when it is "
"present. OpenClaw is not a supported tool."
msgstr ""
"早期版本曾向 ``~/.claude/CLAUDE.md`` 追加角色块,在 ``~/.cursor/rules`` 下写入规则文件,并通过 "
"``anet install --agent openclaw`` 向 ``~/.openclaw/AGENTS.md`` 追加块。\\ "
"``wire`` 会移除 Claude Code 的块和 Cursor 的文件;\\ ``wire --all`` 与 ``unwire "
"--all`` 在 OpenClaw 的块存在时会将其移除。OpenClaw 不是受支持的工具。"

