#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:359
msgid "WorkBuddy"
msgstr "WorkBuddy"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:361
msgid ""
"The entry is written to the user-level file ``~/.workbuddy/mcp.json`` "
"that the WorkBuddy MCP guide describes, in the form of that guide: a "
"``command``, ``args`` and ``env`` under ``mcpServers``. Other servers in "
"the file are kept. A file that is not plain JSON, for example one with "
"comments, is not edited; the command prints the entry for manual "
"insertion."
msgstr ""
"条目写入 WorkBuddy MCP 指南所述的用户级文件 ``~/.workbuddy/mcp.json``,采用该指南的格式:\\ "
"``mcpServers`` 下的 ``command``、\\ ``args`` 与 ``env``。文件中的其他服务器予以保留。不是纯 "
"JSON 的文件(例如含有注释)不会被编辑,命令改为输出需手动加入的条目。"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:367
msgid ""
"Only the parts that the WorkBuddy documentation confirms are written. No "
"operating guide is installed, because no user-level instruction file is "
"documented; the MCP server sends its own instructions on connect, and "
"whether WorkBuddy passes them to the model is not documented. No timeout "
"is written: the documented default is 30 seconds, and the documentation "
"does not state that a user-level entry honours a ``timeout`` member. "
"Until that is confirmed in the current version, call ``wait_task`` with "
"the default wait and repeat the call when the task is still working. The "
"reload behaviour, the menu path and the trust prompt are described in the"
" official guide (`<https://www.workbuddy.cn/docs/workbuddy/From-Beginner-"
"to-Expert-Guide/Function-Description/MCP-Guide>`_); the command prints "
"this reference after it writes the entry. WorkBuddy is distinct from the "
"CodeBuddy command-line program, whose files are under ``~/.codebuddy``; "
"``wire`` does not handle CodeBuddy."
msgstr ""
"仅写入 WorkBuddy 文档已确认的部分。不安装操作指南,因为文档未载明用户级指令文件;MCP 服务器在连接时自行发送其说明,但 "
"WorkBuddy 是否将其交给模型,文档未载明。不写入超时:文档载明的默认值为 30 秒,且未说明用户级条目是否遵从 ``timeout`` "
"成员。在当前版本确认之前,请以默认等待时间调用 ``wait_task``,任务仍在进行时重复调用。重载行为、菜单路径和信任提示见官方指南(\\ "
"`<https://www.workbuddy.cn/docs/workbuddy/From-Beginner-to-Expert-Guide"
"/Function-Description/MCP-Guide>`_\\ ),命令在写入条目后会输出这一参考链接。WorkBuddy 与 "
"CodeBuddy 命令行程序不同,后者的文件位于 ``~/.codebuddy``,\\ ``wire`` 不处理 CodeBuddy。"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:381
msgid ""
"On Windows, ``anet`` runs inside WSL2 and the WorkBuddy application runs "
"on the host. A configuration in which WorkBuddy starts ``wsl.exe -e "
"<path-to-anet> mcp`` has not been tested, and ``wire`` does not write it."
msgstr ""
"在 Windows 上,\\ ``anet`` 运行于 WSL2 内,WorkBuddy 应用运行于宿主系统。由 WorkBuddy 启动 "
"``wsl.exe -e <path-to-anet> mcp`` 的配置尚未经过测试,\\ ``wire`` 也不写入该配置。"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:389
msgid "Hermes and remote agents (``--a2a``)"
msgstr "Hermes 与远程 Agent(``--a2a``)"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:391
msgid ""
"Hermes can call a remote agent through its own A2A client. The option is "
"intended for agents on the network; the Hermes documentation recommends "
"in-process subagents for agents on the same machine. With ``--a2a``, "
"``wire`` adds one ``a2a_agents`` entry per AID to ``config.yaml``. Each "
"entry points at the local A2A interface of the node (see :ref:`howto-"
"local-a2a`), so that the call is signed, sealed and relayed by the node. "
"Hermes does not reach the remote agent directly."
msgstr ""
"Hermes 可通过自带的 A2A 客户端调用远程 Agent。该选项面向网络上的 Agent;对于同一台机器上的 Agent,Hermes "
"文档建议使用进程内子 Agent。使用 ``--a2a`` 时,\\ ``wire`` 会为每个 AID 在 ``config.yaml`` "
"中添加一个 ``a2a_agents`` 条目。每个条目指向节点的本地 A2A 接口(参见 :ref:`howto-local-"
"a2a`),使调用由节点签名、封闭并中继。Hermes 不会直接联系远程 Agent。"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:403
msgid ""
"The ``a2a`` toolset of Hermes is disabled for the command line by "
"default. Enable it once, otherwise ``a2a_call`` is not visible; ``wire`` "
"reminds the operator after writing the entries:"
msgstr ""
"Hermes 的 ``a2a`` 工具集在命令行中默认关闭。需启用一次,否则 ``a2a_call`` 不可见;\\ ``wire`` "
"在写入条目后会提示运维人员:"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:411
msgid ""
"Several AIDs are given as a comma-separated list, as repeated ``--a2a`` "
"options, or as words that follow one ``--a2a``. An AID consists of "
"lowercase letters and digits, 8 to 128 characters long. ``--a2a`` "
"requires ``hermes`` (or ``--all``) in the same command."
msgstr ""
"多个 AID 可以写成逗号分隔的列表、重复的 ``--a2a`` 选项,或跟在一个 ``--a2a`` 之后的多个词。AID "
"由小写字母和数字组成,长度为 8 到 128 个字符。\\ ``--a2a`` 要求同一命令中包含 ``hermes``\\ (或 "
"``--all``)。"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:416
msgid "The resulting entry has the following form:"
msgstr "生成的条目形式如下:"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:430
msgid "Properties of these entries:"
msgstr "这些条目的特性:"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:432
msgid ""
"The entry contains the bearer token of the local A2A interface. The file "
"is therefore kept at mode ``0600``; ``wire`` narrows a wider mode, and "
"``anet agents`` reports a file that is wider."
msgstr ""
"条目中包含本地 A2A 接口的 bearer 令牌。因此文件的权限保持为 ``0600``;\\ ``wire`` 会收窄较宽的权限,\\ "
"``anet agents`` 会报告权限较宽的文件。"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:435
msgid ""
"The address and the token are read from ``a2a_addr.txt`` and "
"``a2a_token.txt`` in the state directory of the a2a module. The files are"
" created when the daemon first serves the interface. If they do not "
"exist, ``wire --a2a`` fails and asks for ``anet up`` first."
msgstr ""
"地址与令牌读取自 a2a 模块状态目录中的 ``a2a_addr.txt`` 与 ``a2a_token.txt``\\ "
"。这些文件在守护进程首次提供该接口时创建。若它们不存在,\\ ``wire --a2a`` 会失败,并提示先运行 ``anet up``\\ 。"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:439
msgid ""
"``wire`` refuses to write the entry while another process holds the "
"recorded port, or while the interface is down because of a port conflict."
" The token would otherwise be handed to the process that holds the port."
msgstr "当另一个进程占用已记录的端口,或接口因端口冲突而未启动时,\\ ``wire`` 拒绝写入该条目。否则令牌会被交给占用该端口的进程。"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:442
msgid ""
"The operating guide for Hermes states that a remote agent listed under "
"``a2a_agents`` is reachable with ``a2a_call`` and that the same spending "
"limits apply."
msgstr ""
"面向 Hermes 的操作指南说明:列在 ``a2a_agents`` 下的远程 Agent 可通过 ``a2a_call`` "
"访问,并且适用相同的支出限额。"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:446
msgid ""
"When the port or the token of the interface changes, the existing entries"
" become invalid. This happens after the file ``a2a_addr.txt`` is removed,"
" after an emergency key rotation, and after a port conflict has been "
"resolved. ``anet agents`` then reports that the port or token of an entry"
" has changed. The entries are rewritten with:"
msgstr ""
"接口的端口或令牌改变时,已有的条目随之失效。这发生在文件 ``a2a_addr.txt`` 被删除、紧急密钥轮换以及端口冲突解决之后。此时 "
"``anet agents`` 会报告某条目的端口或令牌已改变。使用下列命令重写这些条目:"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:456
msgid "To remove individual entries and leave the MCP entry in place:"
msgstr "如只移除个别条目而保留 MCP 条目:"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:462
msgid ""
"``unwire hermes`` without ``--a2a`` removes the MCP entry, the guide, and"
" all entries together with their tokens."
msgstr "不带 ``--a2a`` 的 ``unwire hermes`` 会移除 MCP 条目、指南以及所有条目及其令牌。"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:467
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "说明"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:469
msgid ""
"**Closed by default.** The operating guide tells the coding agent that a "
"new node accepts no task from any other agent and spends nothing. The "
"operator opens either on a terminal, where the commands ask for "
"confirmation; see :ref:`topics-delegation` and :ref:`topics-payments`."
msgstr ""
"**默认关闭。** 操作指南告知编码 Agent:新节点不接受任何其他 Agent "
"的任务,也不产生任何支出。这两项由运维人员在终端中开启,相关命令会要求确认;参见 :ref:`topics-delegation` 与 :ref"
":`topics-payments`\\ 。"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:473
msgid ""
"**Tasks from other agents are untrusted input.** The guide instructs the "
"coding agent not to run commands, read files, send secrets or spend "
"because the text of such a task asks for it. This instruction is a "
"mitigation. The inbound policy and the sandbox described in :ref:`topics-"
"sandbox` are the enforcement."
msgstr ""
"**来自其他 Agent 的任务是不可信输入。** 指南要求编码 Agent "
"不要因为此类任务的文字要求而运行命令、读取文件、发送机密或产生支出。这条指示只是一种缓解措施,真正起约束作用的是入站策略和 :ref"
":`topics-sandbox` 中所述的沙箱。"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:478
msgid ""
"**After a restart of the daemon.** A running ``anet mcp`` process finds "
"the daemon again when the control token has been replaced, and repeats "
"the failed call once. A session needs no restart for that reason alone."
msgstr ""
"**守护进程重启之后。** 控制令牌被替换后,正在运行的 ``anet mcp`` "
"进程会重新找到守护进程,并将失败的调用重试一次。会话无需仅因此重启。"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:481
msgid ""
"**Builds without MCP.** A binary built with ``-tags no_mcp`` has no MCP "
"server; ``anet agents`` and ``anet mcp`` then end with a message that "
"names the build."
msgstr ""
"**不含 MCP 的构建。** 使用 ``-tags no_mcp`` 构建的二进制文件没有 MCP 服务器;此时 ``anet agents``"
" 与 ``anet mcp`` 会以指明该构建的消息结束。"

#: ../../howto/coding-agents.rst:484
msgid ""
"**Reporting.** ``anet doctor`` includes the state of every tool and, for "
"Hermes, the state of each ``a2a_agents`` entry."
msgstr "**报告。** ``anet doctor`` 包含每个工具的状态,对 Hermes 还包含每个 ``a2a_agents`` 条目的状态。"

